{title: O Humdum Suniyo Re}
{artist: A R Rahman Sathiya}
{key: A}

{c: Verse 1}
[Am]O hamdam....        [Am][F]O hamdam suniyo re,
[Am]o jaaniya suniyo re        [Am]O jaaniya shaam ko khidikee se
[F][G][F]chori chori nange paav chaand aayega        [Am][G]Oh suniyo re,
[F][Em]oh jaaniya re        [Am][G]Oh suniyo re,
[F][Em]oh jaaniya re        [C][D]Dhim dhim taanana dhim tananana
[Em][D]o ho o o galiyo se aayega        [C][D]Dhim dhim tanana dhim tananana
[Em][D]o ho o o sitee bajaayega        [C][D]Dhim dhim tanana dhim tananana
[Em][D]o ho o o nim ke ped se        [C][D]Dhim dhim tanana dhim tananana
[Em][D]o ho o o paas bulaayega

